      "score": 267,
      "comments": 200,
      "author": "gavinhking",
      "published": "2026-08-12T14:02:46Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Threat actors spoof AI crawler User-Agents like ClaudeBot to bypass perimeter rate limits and execute automated web vulnerability scans.",
        "User-Agent filtering is insufficient; security teams must enforce reverse DNS checks, IP allowlists, and behavioral analysis to block malicious traffic.",
        "Differentiating real LLM scrapers from spoofed attacks is critical to maintaining application security without disrupting legitimate AI indexing."
      ]
    },
