      "bullets": [
        "Compile-time nameof operators eliminate fragile hardcoded string literals in logging, refactoring, and API parameter validation.",
        "Type-safe identifier extraction reduces runtime reflection overhead while maintaining symbol renaming compatibility with IDE refactoring tools.",
        "Advanced metaprogramming tricks utilize nameof to generate static metadata, ORM mappings, and type-checked domain-specific language expressions."
      ]
